			<item>
				<title>About</title>
				<link>https://owengould.github.io/about/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://owengould.github.io/about/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;I am an incoming PhD Student in &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.public-health.uiowa.edu/biostat/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Biostatistics&lt;/a&gt; at the University of Iowa College of Public Health.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In 2026, I graduated from Grinnell College with a &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.grinnell.edu/academics/majors-concentrations/math&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;major in mathematics&lt;/a&gt; (honors) and a statistics concentration. As a student, I worked as a tutor in the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.grinnell.edu/academics/majors-concentrations/math/math-lab&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Math Lab&lt;/a&gt;, a mentor at the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.grinnell.edu/academics/centers-programs/data-analysis-and-social-inquiry-lab&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Data Analysis and Social Inquiry Lab&lt;/a&gt;, and a grader for the statistics department. I also served on the Statistics SEPC, a student government body that assists in the faculty hiring and review process within the department, as well as the planning of extracurricular activities.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
